## 3. CloudBase 开发规范

### 3.1 云函数结构

**标准云函数模板**:
```javascript
// cloudfunctions/function-name/index.js
const cloud = require('wx-server-sdk');
cloud.init({
  env: cloud.DYNAMIC_CURRENT_ENV
});

const db = cloud.database();
const _ = db.command;

exports.main = async (event, context) => {
  const { action, data } = event;
  const wxContext = cloud.getWXContext();
  
  try {
    switch (action) {
      case 'create':
        return await handleCreate(data, wxContext);
      case 'update':
        return await handleUpdate(data, wxContext);
      case 'delete':
        return await handleDelete(data, wxContext);
      case 'query':
        return await handleQuery(data, wxContext);
      default:
        throw new Error(`Unknown action: ${action}`);
    }
  } catch (error) {
    console.error(`[${action}] Error:`, error);
    return {
      success: false,
      error: error.message
    };
  }
};

// 处理函数
async function handleCreate(data, wxContext) {
  // 实现逻辑
}
```

**云函数命名规范**:
```
- 单一职责: user-management, opportunity-management
- 功能清晰: auth, notification
- 避免过度拆分: ❌ create-user, update-user, delete-user
```

### 3.2 数据库操作规范

**集合命名**: 小驼峰 (camelCase)
```
users
opportunities
tasks
projects
goals
budgetSubjects
issueRecords
```

**查询规范**:
```javascript
// ✅ 推荐: 使用索引字段查询
const result = await db.collection('opportunities')
  .where({
    owner: wxContext.OPENID,
    status: '意向客户'
  })
  .orderBy('createdAt', 'desc')
  .limit(20)
  .get();

// ✅ 推荐: 分页查询
const result = await db.collection('opportunities')
  .where(condition)
  .skip(page * limit)
  .limit(limit)
  .get();

// ❌ 避免: 获取所有数据
const result = await db.collection('opportunities').get();
```

**权限控制**:
```javascript
// 云函数内验证权限
const user = await db.collection('users')
  .where({ _openid: wxContext.OPENID })
  .get();

if (!user.data[0] || user.data[0].status !== 'active') {
  throw new Error('无权限访问');
}
```

### 3.3 前端 SDK 调用规范

**初始化** (`lib/cloudbase.ts`):
```typescript
import cloudbase from '@cloudbase/js-sdk';

const app = cloudbase.init({
  env: import.meta.env.VITE_CLOUDBASE_ENV_ID
});

export const auth = app.auth();
export const db = app.database();
export const callFunction = app.callFunction.bind(app);
```

**云函数调用**:
```typescript
// ✅ 推荐: 封装调用逻辑
export const opportunityService = {
  async create(data: CreateOpportunityInput) {
    const res = await callFunction({
      name: 'opportunity-management',
      data: { action: 'create', data }
    });
    return res.result;
  },
  
  async query(filters: OpportunityFilters) {
    const res = await callFunction({
      name: 'opportunity-management',
      data: { action: 'query', data: filters }
    });
    return res.result;
  }
};
```

